Detection: Successful logon shortly after a burst of failed logons
MITRE ATT&CK: T1110.001 - Brute Force: Password Guessing (successful compromise)
Data source: WinEventLog:Security (EventCode 4624, correlated with 4625)
```

index="endpoint" (EventCode=4625 OR EventCode=4624)
| transaction Account_Name maxspan=15m startswith=(EventCode=4625) endswith=(EventCode=4624)
| where eventcount > 5
| table _time, Account_Name, Account_Domain, ComputerName, eventcount, duration
| sort -_time
